/** Multimap:

--> same as Map
--> Allows duplicates

Header File : <map>

(i) Declaration: multimap<int> m
(ii) Insertion: m.insert(pair value)
(iii) Deletion: m.erase(key) or m.erase (pos)
        --> To erase only one occurance :
        --> find --> erase
(iv) Find: it = m.find(key)
(v)Accessing: using iterator
             auto i = m.begin()
             cout<<i->first <<" "<<i->second
(vi)Updating: i->second = new_value
